<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="tracera-diagram-gen" version="24.0.0" type="device"><diagram id="14-runtime-demo" name="Runtime demo: shop-ui before and after the patch"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="900" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="frame" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1600" height="900" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="titlebar" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FF6B35;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="26" width="56" height="5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;Runtime demo: shop-ui before and after the patch&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;fontSize=26;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="36" width="1520" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="A cart page with one planted bug, driven in a browser inside the sandbox. The screenshots are evidence; the outcome still comes from the rules." style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="74" width="1520" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a0" value="&lt;b&gt;1  The fixture&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;fixtures/shop-ui is the Lumen Goods cart page, built into a git repository by npm run demo:setup. A refactor turns &amp;gt;= into &amp;gt;, so an order of exactly $50.00 is charged shipping though the page promises free shipping from $50." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="125" width="270" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a1" value="&lt;b&gt;2  Register and report&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Registered as a local repository with install, test and start commands and an app on port 4173 (ready path /health, base path /cart). The bug report names the page /cart." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="352" y="125" width="270" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a2" value="&lt;b&gt;3  Plan browser steps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The repository has an app and a start command and the report names a page, so a model proposes steps in a small DSL: open, click, fill, expect text, and so on. Code validates them; at most 40 steps." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="664" y="125" width="270" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a3" value="&lt;b&gt;4  Run before the patch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The app starts with no network and a browser container drives it. Phase: before. A PNG screenshot, how the app started and each step are stored as evidence." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="976" y="125" width="270" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a4" value="&lt;b&gt;5  Hypothesis and patch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A model cites src/pricing.js and proposes the one-line fix, &amp;gt;= instead of &amp;gt;. Code checks the patch policy and builds the diff." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1288" y="125" width="270" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b0" value="&lt;b&gt;6  Run after the patch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The exact reviewed diff is applied to a fresh copy and the same steps run again. Phase: after. A second screenshot is stored." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="385" width="270" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b1" value="&lt;b&gt;7  Derive the outcome&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;deriveVerificationOutcome combines the reproduction check with the test suite. Browser assertions never set the outcome themselves." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="352" y="385" width="270" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b2" value="&lt;b&gt;8  Review page&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Before and after screenshots sit beside the diff, with each step in words, how the app started and the stored outcome." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="664" y="385" width="270" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b3" value="&lt;b&gt;Visual claim rule&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The page may say the patch changed what the reproduction showed only if the reproduction check passed and, in every after run, the app started, at least one assertion passed and none failed." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="976" y="385" width="270" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b4" value="&lt;b&gt;Hosted demo&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;There is no Docker in the hosted container, so these runs are recorded as blocked: analysis only, no run screenshots." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F3F1EF;strokeColor=#9A9088;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#6B625A;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1288" y="385" width="270" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n0" value="&lt;b&gt;What is stored for each run&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A screenshot as evidence with provenance (method browser_sandbox, phase, patch, executor and image), the start-up record (health check, first page load), console and page errors, blocked and failed requests, and every step with its message." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="625" width="740" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;How the browser is kept in&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The app container has no network. The browser shares its loopback-only namespace and aborts every request outside the app origin. The runner never evaluates code from the model or the repository." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="625" width="750" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s0" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t0" value="Code or model step" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="82" y="860" width="140" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s1" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="244" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t1" value="Sandbox run" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="286" y="860" width="90" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s2" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="398" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t2" value="Review" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="860" width="54" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s3" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F3F1EF;strokeColor=#9A9088;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#6B625A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="516" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t3" value="Blocked without Docker" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="558" y="860" width="169" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t4" value="Next" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="795" y="860" width="39" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a0" target="a1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a1" target="a2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a2" target="a3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a3" target="a4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a4" target="b0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1423" y="350"/><mxPoint x="175" y="350"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b0" target="b1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b1" target="b2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="749" y="871" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="787" y="871" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
